cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or pipeline in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "Bi-Manual VLA: a bimanual SO-101 dinner-table manipulation dataset and pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline that generates a bimanual SO-101 dinner-table
  manipulation dataset in MuJoCo and fine-tunes a Vision-Language-Action policy
  on it. Contact physics runs on CPU MuJoCo; image rendering runs on the GPU
  through MuJoCo Warp's ray-traced batch renderer, requiring neither EGL nor
  OpenGL.
type: software
